---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const [staticData] = await getCollection("staticData");
const {
  profileAlt,
  profileLink,
  profileImage,
  profileName,
  profileTitle,
  email,
  emailIconName,
  github,
  timetableImage,
  timetableTitle,
  contactSectionButtonText,
} = staticData.data;
---

<section class="py-8 px-8 max-md:py-1 mb-4 scroll-m-16" id="timetable">
    <h1
        class="text-4xl font-black leading-14 text-blacktext dark:text-white items-center justify-center text-center"
        >
        {timetableTitle}
    </h1>
<div
    class="mx-auto mb-4 mt-16 h-full w-full max-w-7xl rounded-2xl flex justify-center items-center max-md:h-auto">
        <div class="relative z-20 flex justify-center items-center w-200 mx-auto">
            <div
                class="mt-3 w-full aspect-square bg-center bg-contain bg-no-repeat scale-110 transition-transform"
                style={`background-image: url(${timetableImage})`}
                aria-label={timetableImage}
            ></div>
        </div>
</div>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-8">
    <div class="flex gap-4 items-center justify-center text-center">
    </div>

    <div class="z-2 text-center mx-auto text-lg max-xl:text-base max-w-4xl dark:text-gray-200 text-blacktext my-6 leading-6 font-medium">
        <p class="mb-6">Scopri la programmazione ufficiale dei corsi per la nuova stagione. Un'offerta completa di Grappling, BJJ, Judo e Strength & Conditioning strutturata per soddisfare ogni esigenza di training, dai turni in pausa pranzo fino alle sessioni serali e al weekend.</p>
        
        <div class="schedule-container text-left inline-block space-y-4 w-full max-w-2xl">
            <div class="day-schedule">
                <h3 class="font-bold">Lunedì</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>12:30 - 13:30</strong> | Grappling (Pausa Pranzo)</li>
                    <li><strong>18:30 - 19:30</strong> | S&amp;C (Strength &amp; Conditioning)</li>
                    <li><strong>19:30 - 21:00</strong> | Grappling</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="day-schedule">
                <h3 class="font-bold">Martedì</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>12:30 - 13:30</strong> | Grappling (Pausa Pranzo)</li>
                    <li><strong>19:30 - 21:00</strong> | Judo</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="day-schedule">
                <h3 class="font-bold">Mercoledì</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>12:30 - 13:30</strong> | BJJ con Gi</li>
                    <li><strong>18:30 - 19:30</strong> | S&amp;C (Strength &amp; Conditioning)</li>
                    <li><strong>19:30 - 21:00</strong> | Grappling</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="day-schedule">
                <h3 class="font-bold">Giovedì</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>12:30 - 13:30</strong> | Grappling (Pausa Pranzo)</li>
                    <li><strong>19:30 - 21:00</strong> | Judo</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="day-schedule">
                <h3 class="font-bold">Venerdì</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>12:30 - 13:30</strong> | Grappling (Pausa Pranzo)</li>
                    <li><strong>17:30 - 18:30</strong> | S&amp;C (Strength &amp; Conditioning)</li>
                    <li><strong>18:30 - 20:00</strong> | Grappling</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="day-schedule">
                <h3 class="font-bold">Sabato</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>11:00 - 13:00</strong> | Grappling Open Mat</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <slot />
  </div>
</section>